## Repository Structure (from Spec)

- `frontend/` — Next.js app; `src/app/` (landing, dashboard, new-proposal, results), `src/components/`, `src/types/assessment.ts` (TypeScript types matching backend models).
- `backend/` — FastAPI (main.py, models.py), calculator/, data_sources/, ml/, llm/. Scripts live under `backend/scripts/` (e.g. download_data.py, load_census_to_sqlite.py, train_grid_model.py).
- `data/` — Pre-downloaded CSVs, census SQLite, reserves centroids (gitignored except samples).
- `models/` — grid_strain_model.pkl.

