## Judging & Design

- **Judging (projectoverview.md):** (1) Innovation & originality, (2) Technical complexity & execution, (3) Product experience & design, (4) Impact & practical value.
- **Target award:** Google Best Sustainability AI Hack — most innovative AI solution for environmental/sustainability challenges and real-world impact.
- **UI contrast:** Show company “Promises” (e.g. soft green) vs “Calculated Reality” (bold charts). Map-first where relevant; minimal, professional for council/planners.
